00:35:34.440 --> 00:35:36.559
I fucking warned you, you can't do this.

00:35:36.759 --> 00:35:37.579
What's gonna happen?

00:35:37.619 --> 00:35:38.340
We need eyes.

00:35:38.340 --> 00:35:42.340
Neither can you.

00:36:08.340 --> 00:36:15.780
Nice outfit.

00:36:18.100 --> 00:36:19.800
Goes with the community service.

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:23.640
Which is getting off easy, after what I did.

00:36:27.840 --> 00:36:29.140
Lex, thanks for all your help.

00:36:30.840 --> 00:36:33.180
What good are lawyers if they can't jump through hoops?

00:36:35.079 --> 00:36:36.620
Any word on your friend Seth?

00:36:37.480 --> 00:36:38.320
He's still in a coma.

00:36:38.320 --> 00:36:38.340
He's still in a coma.

00:36:38.340 --> 00:36:42.140
They don't know what he'll remember, if and when he ever wakes up.

00:36:44.380 --> 00:36:45.900
Lex, I'm sorry I let you down.

00:36:48.120 --> 00:36:51.579
I can't defend my behavior, magnetism or no magnetism.

00:36:53.079 --> 00:36:55.320
But I'd really like my job at the Talon back.

00:36:55.500 --> 00:36:55.760
Done.

00:36:57.600 --> 00:36:59.240
I'm serious, the place needs you.

00:36:59.640 --> 00:37:00.840
Then I make a lousy latte.

00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:05.200
Lex.

00:37:05.200 --> 00:37:08.320
Lana, I did a lot worse things than steal a sports car...

00:37:08.320 --> 00:37:08.940
...when I was your age.

00:37:09.519 --> 00:37:12.559
And I'm the last guy to criticize someone for falling for the wrong person.

00:37:15.519 --> 00:37:17.019
But I'm sure the right guy's out there.

00:37:17.019 --> 00:37:17.059
I'm sorry.

00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:32.840
Lex.

00:37:36.700 --> 00:37:38.300
