00:38:47.159 --> 00:38:48.139
And I told him that.

00:38:49.200 --> 00:38:51.019
But then he threatened to fire my dad.

00:38:53.900 --> 00:38:57.019
So I figured that in order to get out of my agreement with him,

00:38:57.099 --> 00:38:58.700
I had to find something on your father.

00:38:59.119 --> 00:39:00.720
You know, something damaging enough

00:39:00.720 --> 00:39:02.900
