00:39:37.159 --> 00:39:37.819
Metropolis.

00:39:42.920 --> 00:39:45.199
He was also your father's closest childhood friend.

00:40:01.899 --> 00:40:02.259
Lana.

00:40:04.399 --> 00:40:06.379
I, uh, came by to say thank you

00:40:06.379 --> 00:40:06.960
for helping me.

00:40:06.960 --> 00:40:08.240
For saving me from Seth.

00:40:09.099 --> 00:40:10.019
And to apologize.

00:40:11.659 --> 00:40:12.699
For real this time.

00:40:14.679 --> 00:40:15.920
