00:40:59.360 --> 00:40:59.800
delightful.

00:41:01.019 --> 00:41:01.139
I...

00:41:01.199 --> 00:41:01.699
can I?

00:41:01.760 --> 00:41:02.619
that don't hurt you.

00:41:03.720 --> 00:41:04.639
I'm sorry.

00:41:04.699 --> 00:41:04.780
No, it's okay.

00:41:04.860 --> 00:41:05.039
No, it is okay.

00:41:05.099 --> 00:41:05.159
No, it's okay.

00:41:05.159 --> 00:41:05.699
So, does anyone ever say pursue,

00:41:05.699 --> 00:41:05.800
Slowly now you can see things going through your face?

00:41:05.800 --> 00:41:06.179
�

00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:08.960
I was way off with Seth.

00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:14.960
He still had the courage to be honest with me.

00:41:15.960 --> 00:41:17.960
Then he used his abilities to manipulate you.

00:41:17.960 --> 00:41:19.960
I am not condoning what he did.

00:41:20.960 --> 00:41:22.960
Believe me, I'm paying for it.

00:41:26.960 --> 00:41:32.960
Still felt good caring for someone and having my feelings returned.

00:41:32.960 --> 00:41:36.960
I want that again.

00:41:40.960 --> 00:41:42.960
I don't expect you to wait forever for me.

00:41:42.960 --> 00:41:43.960
Good.

00:41:44.960 --> 00:41:48.960
Because one of these days someone's gonna come along that's right for me.

00:41:49.960 --> 00:41:52.960
And I'm going to want to be with that person.

00:41:55.960 --> 00:41:57.960
And you're gonna have to deal with that.

